# {{.ProjectName}}

NestJS microservices monorepo with layered architecture.

## Stack

- **Language:** TypeScript
- **Framework:** NestJS
- **Communication:** NATS
- **ORM:** Prisma
- **Database:** PostgreSQL

## Structure

```
apps/
  gateway/          # HTTP entry point — proxies requests via NATS
    src/
      items/        # Items module (controller → service → NATS)
  sample-ms/        # Sample microservice — handles business logic
    src/
      items/        # Items module (message handler → service → Prisma)
      common/       # Database, DTOs, exceptions
      config/       # Environment validation
      nats/         # NATS client module
```

## Quick Start

```bash
cp .env.example .env
docker compose up -d
cd apps/sample-ms && npx prisma db push
```

## Development

```bash
# Install dependencies
pnpm install

# Start NATS and PostgreSQL
docker compose up -d nats postgres

# Start services
pnpm start:gateway
pnpm start:sample-ms
```

## Endpoints

- `POST /api/items` — Create an item (gateway → NATS → sample-ms)
- `GET  /api/items/:id` — Get item by ID
